folds making the project a healthy investment. For the buyers who want to dwell in there cannot be a better project s it has all the basic requirements of the buyer fulfilled with it being located in one of the most popular locations of Mumbai. The project offers 2 and 3 BHK ready to move flats having an area in the range of 1125-1555 sqft.\n\n### Sports Amenities\n\n* ![Sports Facility](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804694_sport-facility.svg) Sports Facility\n* ![Kids Play Area](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804595_kids-play-area.svg) Kids Play Area\n* ![Swimming Pool](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804565_swimming-pool.svg) Swimming Pool\n\n### Convenience Amenities\n\n* ![Lifts](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804644_lift.svg) Lifts\n* ![Car Parking](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804679_parking.svg) Car Parking\n* ![Water Storage](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528886749_water_storage.svg) Water Storage\n* ![Waste Disposal](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528886685_waste_disposal.svg) Waste Disposal\n* ![Maintenance Staff](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804773_maintenance-staff.svg) Maintenance Staff\n* ![Wi-fi connectivity](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804529_wifi.svg) Wi-fi connectivity\n* ![Multipurpose Hall](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804708_multipurpose-hall.svg) Multipurpose Hall\n\n## Floor Plans of Chheda New Gagangiri\n\n![Chheda New Gagangiri Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/floorplan/41404/1521723537Chheda_New_Gagangiri_2bhk.jpeg \"Chheda New Gagangiri Floor Plan 1125 sqft\")\n\n2 BHK (1125 Sq. Ft.)\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n## EMI Calculator\n\nLoan Amount (80% of Total Cost) : 2.79 Cr\n\n## Rental Options Available!\n\nExplore rental flats in Godrej E-City\n\n [Check Ren