artment benefits from excellent natural\n\n![Ashish Mhatre  profile picture](https://img.squareyards.com/connect/profilepic/919833284493638733287250457098.jpg?aio=w-32;h-32;crop;)\n![1 BHK Apartment For Sale in Govind Nagar](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639218118837374699-0808260651235123.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\n## 1 BHK Flat for Sale in Govind Nagar, Mumbai\n\nGovind Nagar, Mumbai\n*![Location map of 1 BHK Flat for Sale in Govind Nagar, Mumbai located at 19.2354314, 72.8493324](/assets/images/map-icon.png)*\n\n![Location map of 1 BHK Flat for Sale in Govind Nagar, Mumbai located at 19.2354314, 72.8493324](/assets/images/map-icon.png)\n\n**₹ 1.35 Cr**\n\nThis inviting one-bedroom Flats in Govind Nagar, Borivali West, Mumbai is available for sale at 1.35 crore, presenting a comfortable living space of 571 Square Feet on the 5th floor of a 6-story building. The apartment is furnished and offers a pleasant Road View, perfect for those who enjoy city life.Residents will appreciate the convenience of 24 x 7 Water Supply\n\n![2 BHK Apartment For Sale in Devki Nagar CHS, Borivali West](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639033060985861802-0601260221382138.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\n## 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Borivali West, Mumbai *Location map of 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Borivali West, Mumbai located at 19.23918, 72.84706*\n\n![Location map of 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Borivali West, Mumbai located at 19.23918, 72.84706](/assets/images/map-icon.png)\n\n**₹ 1.4 Cr**\n\nExperience urban living redefined in this well-appointed 2-bedroom, 2-bathroom Flats situated in Borivali West, Mumbai, available for sale at 1.4 crore.Spanning 520 square feet on the 8th floor of Devki Nagar CHS, this furnished residence offers a refreshing Road View, bringing the city's pulse right to your doorstep.Built within the last 2 to 4 years, this home on the 8th\n\n![Sunil Ransure  profile picture](https://img.squareyards.com/connect/profilepic/9