oy a range of amenities designed for modern living, such as kids` play areas, power backup, 24\n\n![1 BHK Apartment For Sale in JK Paradise Borivali West, Borivali West](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639161100892048081-030626070129129.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\n## 1 BHK Flat for Sale in Borivali West, Mumbai *Location map of 1 BHK Flat for Sale in Borivali West, Mumbai located at 19.234515, 72.848406*\n\n![Location map of 1 BHK Flat for Sale in Borivali West, Mumbai located at 19.234515, 72.848406](/assets/images/map-icon.png)\n\n**₹ 1.4 Cr**\n\nFind your new home in Borivali West with this ready-to-move-in Flats from JK Paradise Borivali West. Priced at 1.4 Cr, this 490 square feet semi-furnished space offers 1 bedroom and 0 bathrooms, situated on the 4th floor of a 5-story building.The property is over 10 years old and provides essential amenities like power backup, 24 x 7 security, 24\\*7 water supply,\n\nPersonalized home recommendations based on your lifestyle, location, and budget.\n\n![Smarter home match recommendation preview](/assets/images/recommandation-images/recommendation-preview.png)\n![Personalized home matching](/assets/images/recommandation-images/icon-star.svg)\n\nRecommendations tailored to your real needs.\n\n![Smarter locality suggestions](/assets/images/recommandation-images/pin-icon.svg)\n\nDiscover neighborhoods that fit your lifestyle.\n\n![Budget aware recommendations](/assets/images/recommandation-images/wallet-icon.svg)\n\nFind homes that match your budget.\n\n![Personalized property recommendation cards](/assets/images/recommandation-images/property-img.png)\n![voice search]()![Bangalore city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/bangalore.svg)\n![Chennai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/chennai.svg)\n![Delhi city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/delhi.svg)\n![Gurgaon city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/gurgaon.svg)\n![Hyderabad city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/hyderabad.svg)\n![Kolkata city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/kolkata.svg)\n![Lucknow city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/lucknow.svg)\n![Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/mumbai.svg)\n![Navi Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/navi-mumbai.svg)\n![Noida city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/noida.svg)\n![Pune city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/pune.svg)\n![Thane city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/thane.svg)\n\nSquare Yards is India's largest Integrated real estate platform, with category leadership presence across multiple touchpoints of consumer home ownership journey. With Urbanisation and rising disposable incomes as the core theme, Square Yards, with 8mn+ monthly traffic and ~USD 7bn+ GTV, is the largest and asset light proxy play to the growing residential demand story of India. One of the few Indian start ups to taste global success with presence in 100+ cities across 9 countries, Square Yards is at the forefront of tech adoption in the sector, with multiple patents across VR/AI domains.\n\n![SQUAREYARDS ANDROID APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/google-play.png)\n![SQUAREYARDS IOS APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/app-store.png)\n![loader](/assets/images/loader3-big.gif)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/new-gagangiri/27474/project","title":"New Gagangiri, Borivali West, Mumbai - Price on Request","raw_content":"![Squareyards Logo](/assets/images/squareyards.png?aio=w-82;h-32;crop;)\n![Chheda Group developer logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/chheda-group-7985.jpg?aio=w-128;h-128;crop;)\n\n# New Gagangiri Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n![New Gagangiri Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/new-gagangiri-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-725;h-350;crop;)\n![New Gagangiri Tower View](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/new-gagangiri-project-tower-view1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n**Price on Request**\n\n## About New Gagangiri, Borivali West by Chheda Group\n\n## New Gagangiri Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for New Gagangiri.\n\n| Unit Type (Saleable) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  1255 Sq. Ft. | **Price on Request** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nNew Gagangiri's average asking price is rising quarter-on-quarter, compared with Borivali West.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | New Gagangiri | Borivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 25250 | 30900 |\n| Mar 2026 | 24050 | 31300 |\n| Dec 2025 | 24050 | 30300 |\n| Sep 2025 | 33850 | 30350 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nNew Gagangiri avg. price is ₹ 25.2 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Borivali West at ₹ 30.9 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| [Kalpataru Towers](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kalpataru-towers/2944/project \"Kalpataru Towers\") | ₹ 36,650 |\n| [Mayfair Greens](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/mayfair-greens/28962/project \"Mayfair Greens\") | ₹ 34,100 |\n| Borivali West | ₹ 30,900 |\n| [Horizon Green](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/horizon-green/103711/project \"Horizon Green\") | ₹ 30,100 |\n| Current Project **New Gagangiri** | ₹ 25,250 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in New Gagangiri start from ₹ 33 K with options available for 1 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In New Gagangiri | In Borivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | ₹ 33 K | ₹ 32.7 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 45.5 K |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 74.4 K |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for New Gagangiri.\n\n#### Mumbai's Water Stock at 95.97% with Seven Lakes Holding High Levels\n\nMumbai's water stock has reached 95.97%, with seven lakes maintaining high levels. This ensures a stable water supply for the city, though civic authorities continue to monitor reservoir levels and rainfall.\n\nRent in New Gagangiri ranges from ₹ 33 K to ₹ 55 K with options available for 1 BHK, 2 BHK.\n\nDuring Q2'2026, average property prices for New Gagangiri moved from ₹ 24,050/sqft to ₹ 25,250/sqft, reflecting a 4.99% rise.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### Mumbai-Pune Expressway 'Missing Link' Project Set for May 1 Inauguration, Promising Safer and Faster Travel\n\nThe highly anticipated 'Missing Link' project on the Mumbai-Pune Expressway is set to be inaugurated on May 1, significantly reducing travel time by approximately 30 minutes and enhancing safety. The 10.5-km stretch features tunnels and a bridge, bypassing the accident-prone Khandala Ghat. This infrastructure upgrade is expected to ease traffic congestion, improve travel safety.\n\n## New Gagangiri Floor Plans\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 2 BHK 1255 Sq. Ft. Apartment in New Gagangiri, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:Price on Request\n\n## Rental Listings in New Gagangiri\n\nExplore rental listings currently available in New Gagangiri, Mumbai.\n\n![1 BHK +Apartment For Rent in New Gagangiri in Borivali West, Mumbai]()\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n![1 BHK Apartm