istration. Rental demand is supported by the locality’s ranking of 86 and connectivity indices.\n\n### Is New Gagangiri more expensive than under-construction projects nearby?\n\nReady to Move projects like New Gagangiri may be priced slightly higher, but they eliminate construction delays, GST, and rental overlap costs.\n\nThis website is only for the purpose of providing information regarding real estate projects in different geographies. Any information which is being provided on this website is not an advertisement or a solicitation. The company has not verified the information and the compliances of the projects. Further, the company has not checked the RERA\\* registration status of the real estate projects listed herein. The company does not make any representation in regards to the compliances done against these projects. Please note that you should make yourself aware about the RERA\\* registration status of the listed real estate projects.\n\n**\\*Real Estate (Regulation & Development) Act, 2016.**\n\n![Bangalore city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/bangalore.svg)\n![Chennai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/chennai.svg)\n![Delhi city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/delhi.svg)\n![Gurgaon city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/gurgaon.svg)\n![Hyderabad city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/hyderabad.svg)\n![Kolkata city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/kolkata.svg)\n![Lucknow city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/lucknow.svg)\n![Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/mumbai.svg)\n![Navi Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/navi-mumbai.svg)\n![Noida city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/noida.svg)\n![Pune city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/pune.svg)\n![Thane city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/thane.svg)\n\nSquare Yards is India's largest Integrated real estate platform, with category leadership presence across multiple touchpoints of consumer home ownership journey. With Urbanisation and rising disposable incomes as the core theme, Square Yards, with 8mn+ monthly traffic and ~USD 7bn+ GTV, is the largest and asset light proxy play to the growing residential demand story of India. One of the few Indian start ups to taste global success with presence in 100+ cities across 9 countries, Square Yards is at the forefront of tech adoption in the sector, with multiple patents across VR/AI domains.\n\n![SQUAREYARDS ANDROID APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/google-play.png)\n![SQUAREYARDS IOS APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/app-store.png)\n![loader](/assets/images/loader3-big.gif)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/rent/property-for-rent-in-new-gagangiri-mumbai","title":"New Gagangiri Flats for Rent - 6+ Options in Borivali West, Mumbai | Square Yards","raw_content":"![Squareyards Logo](/assets/images/squareyards.png?aio=w-82;h-32;crop;)\n![Chheda Group Developer Logo]()\n\n# Flats for Rent in New Gagangiri, Borivali West Mumbai\n\n![1 BHK Apartment For Rent in New Gagangiri, Borivali West](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639238848830507209-010926184123050.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\n## 1 BHK Flat for Rent in Borivali West, Mumbai *Location map of 1 BHK Flat for Rent in Borivali West, Mumbai located at 19.236924, 72.847616*\n\n![Location map of 1 BHK Flat for Rent in Borivali West, Mumbai located at 19.236924, 72.847616](/assets/images/map-icon.png)\n\n**₹ 33,000**\n/ Per Month\n\nThis 1-bedroom, 2-bathroom Flats in Borivali West offers a comfortable 650 Square Feet of living space on the 11th floor of the New Gagangiri building. Enjoy the convenience of a road view and essential amenities such as power backup and a lift, ensuring a smooth living experience even during power outages.The apartment is semi-furnished, providing a good balance between customization and\n\n![1 BHK Apartment For Rent in New Gagangiri, Borivali West](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_63911